@startuml state-diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans TC"

title State Diagram
caption 球隊/球員資料管理 - 狀態轉換圖

' === 球隊狀態圖 ===
state "球隊生命週期" as TeamLifecycle {
  [*] --> Creating : CreateTeam

  state Creating {
    [*] --> Validating
    Validating --> Validated : 驗證通過
    Validating --> Invalid : 驗證失敗
    Invalid --> [*]
    Validated --> Created : TeamCreated
  }

  Creating --> Active : TeamCreated 事件
  note on link
    teamId 已分配
    status = Active
    playerCount = 0
  end note

  Active --> Active : UpdateTeam\n(TeamUpdated)
  note on link
    可更新 teamName, description
    觸發 InvalidateCache Policy
  end note

  Active --> Inactive : 手動停用
  Inactive --> Active : 手動啟用

  Active --> Deleting : DeleteTeam
  Inactive --> Deleting : DeleteTeam

  state Deleting {
    [*] --> DeletingPlayers
    DeletingPlayers --> CachingInvalidating : TeamPlayersDeleted
    CachingInvalidating --> [*]
  }

  Deleting --> [*] : TeamDeleted
  note on link
    所有球員已刪除
    快取已失效
  end note
}

' === 球員狀態圖 ===
state "球員生命週期" as PlayerLifecycle {
  [*] --> Creating : CreatePlayer

  state Creating {
    [*] --> ValidatingJerseyNumber
    ValidatingJerseyNumber --> ValidatingPosition : 背號有效
    ValidatingJerseyNumber --> Invalid : 背號無效或重複
    ValidatingPosition --> ValidatingData : 位置有效
    ValidatingPosition --> Invalid : 位置無效
    ValidatingData --> Created : 驗證通過
    ValidatingData --> Invalid : 資料無效
    Invalid --> [*]
  }

  Creating --> Active : PlayerCreated 事件
  note on link
    playerId 已分配
    sortOrder 自動分配 (max+1)
    觸發 RefreshPlayerList Policy
  end note

  Active --> Active : UpdatePlayer\n(PlayerUpdated)
  note on link
    可更新所有欄位
    觸發 RefreshPlayerList Policy
  end note

  Active --> Reordering : UpdatePlayerOrder
  Reordering --> Active : PlayerOrderChanged
  note on link
    sortOrder 已更新
    觸發 RefreshPlayerList Policy
  end note

  Active --> [*] : DeletePlayer\n(PlayerDeleted)
  note on link
    觸發 RefreshPlayerList Policy
  end note

  Active --> [*] : 所屬球隊被刪除\n(TeamPlayersDeleted)
  note on link
    Cascade Delete
    由 CascadeDeletePlayers Policy 執行
  end note
}

' === Policy 觸發狀態 ===
state "Policy 執行狀態" as PolicyStates {
  state "InvalidateCache Policy" as CachePolicy {
    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Executing : TeamCreated/Updated/Deleted
    Executing --> [*] : TeamCacheInvalidated
  }

  state "RefreshPlayerList Policy" as RefreshPolicy {
    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Executing : PlayerCreated/Updated/Deleted/OrderChanged
    Executing --> [*] : PlayerListRefreshed
  }

  state "AutoLoadPlayers Policy" as LoadPolicy {
    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Executing : TeamContextEstablished
    Executing --> QueryingPlayers : QueryPlayerList
    QueryingPlayers --> [*] : PlayerListRetrieved
  }
}

' 圖例
legend right
  |= 狀態類型 |= 說明 |
  | **Creating** | 建立中，執行驗證 |
  | **Active** | 正常使用狀態 |
  | **Inactive** | 停用狀態（僅球隊） |
  | **Deleting** | 刪除中 |
  | **[*]** | 終止狀態 |

  **Event 觸發 Policy 的時機**:
  - TeamCreated/Updated/Deleted → InvalidateCache
  - PlayerCreated/Updated/Deleted/OrderChanged → RefreshPlayerList
  - TeamContextEstablished → AutoLoadPlayers
endlegend

note right of TeamLifecycle
  **Invariants**:
  - 球隊名稱必須唯一
  - 球隊名稱長度 2-50 字元
  - 刪除球隊時會 cascade delete 所有球員
end note

note right of PlayerLifecycle
  **Invariants**:
  - 背號在同球隊內必須唯一 (0-99)
  - 守備位置必須為標準棒球位置
  - 球員必須屬於一個存在的球隊
  - sortOrder 自動分配，不可手動設定
end note

@enduml
